n":"Many of our initiatives are designed to reach beyond urban centres—extending opportunities to tribal regions and remote villages, where talent and potential often go unnoticed. We choose to grow with those who are most in need of opportunity, not merely those who already have access to it."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[#A9153B] text-base pt-2","children":"This is why we enjoy what we do. Our growth is not just measured in numbers, but in the lives, we touch, the trust we earn, and the long-term relationships we build."}]]}]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-24 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-display","children":"Leadership"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-1","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-display","children":"Mrs. Sheeba Paul,"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#A9153B]","children":"Managing Director – Exodus Exports (P). Ltd."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"direction":"right","className":"lg:col-span-5 space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-elevated border-2 border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden group","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/founder.jpg","alt":"Mrs. Sheeba Paul - Managing Director, Exodus Exports","fill":true,"priority":true,"sizes":"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw","className":"object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"}],[